/* 资源详情 —— 逐条对照原型 screens/resource-detail.html。1px 记 2rpx。
 *
 * 这一页原型自带一套配色，和教研培训那几页不同：底色米白 #f5f4f1，主色蓝 #2f6feb。
 * app.wxss 的令牌是青绿那套，所以这里把 page 的底色和用到的颜色都写死覆盖。 */

page {
  background: #f5f4f1;
}

.page {
  padding: 24rpx 32rpx 40rpx;
}

.detail-card {
  padding: 36rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  background: #ffffff;
  box-shadow: 0 2rpx 6rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
}

.detail-title {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
  font-size: 40rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.tag-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12rpx;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 28rpx;
}

.tag {
  padding: 8rpx 20rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: #e8f0fe;
  color: #2f6feb;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

.sec-title {
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #1a1916;
}

.sec-title--gap {
  margin-top: 36rpx;
}

.body-text {
  display: block;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: #1a1916;
}

/* 原型的 `.detail-card .link-card` 覆盖了外层规则：底色换成页面底色，加一条描边，去掉投影。 */
.link-card {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 28rpx;
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid #e8e5df;
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  background: #f5f4f1;
}

.link-card--hover {
  background: #f8f8f6;
}

.link-card__body {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

.link-card__name {
  display: block;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.link-card__meta {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #8c8a84;
}

.link-card__arrow {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  margin-left: 16rpx;
  color: #2f6feb;
  font-size: 32rpx;
}
